{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:68d85670272f50bc48664ee05149344dd690232a9ff03232d1d7d36f078c0998",
      "source_sha256": "8733d5fb6d0fde1f886fca92aa31216208b2f297d6721a940477f63a99ae36c3",
      "translation": "我在水色湿地，看见了一个人类。说是要找什么“克罗塞尔大人”，我就带着那人，往柯塔马雷走了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2c88e094e01086cfd0b363a82fc3b8d12a155993e9f9c916048bd16f89972b71",
      "source_sha256": "53863e362c8cfa0cfe6d82c61be6861920f5f9512dd21b78979a0c685767117e",
      "translation": "克罗塞尔大人……是玛莉丝吗？可是，玛莉丝为什么会……？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a80c117f00f4de3db78f97738e9ee63729e7b3540aeb4ef33395edf025aa6dfd",
      "source_sha256": "2cb4efcbc5ca1e7a78c8c84b34002a0e1ed95f1d5f9272dcb64a9360a7b767e2",
      "translation": "可是，途中遭到了怪物袭击……我也想做点什么，可凭我的力量，实在办不到。最后，只能勉强逃出来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:086ef2b4d953f697a8e68e2b245a0846b64adf44e354eea5179051f6fe97e1d1",
      "source_sha256": "335d2b4b11aa1ba863dd65ebfcf770cf74b0666a8d1fba6199def74979e7ce7b",
      "translation": "那就是说，玛莉丝被抓走了！？现在在哪里？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1fb74476a843669eee95ff643c04317f3818b2cb676a38af7af507b4be32eecc",
      "source_sha256": "fe5544081f44ccc1c302ea02e2c775ec028cffa5cb56ad6d0a5ff62140a45362",
      "translation": "等一下。你要一个人去？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ef6874c4587fa223d79d02287887f6b3adc14c7e8314b061c475a2b0d3a7acff",
      "source_sha256": "68e92a6052caec1f3e56f78e18946592788e7bd675ef4f6b99fca5a6c13905b1",
      "translation": "什么啊，你什么时候在那里的？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ee010c4d37f0105a9a9b7e73d9a603708468988109e554e14d814e1fcfde0ca3",
      "source_sha256": "0b002a57096aec6e0213205e4a297f8db32c174153a47d1a628ec8ddcb6452a9",
      "translation": "谁知道呢。既然如此，我也来帮忙。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ca3a04dfc2dff7cbfb808f7c31daaf0e6707f4ed6c25592e8ce185fbfa4170ab",
      "source_sha256": "0f3637b072447309dd09518c0d2bee551b2bbbcf5adbb9f345a7cdee312c6c6c",
      "translation": "真是的……反正，就算阻止你，你也不会听。不过，这事得瞒着公主殿下。我不想让她担心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:08573c0bdbee89e973463332de68c16e110c9afd5f9122ee72ce0d344b27880f",
      "source_sha256": "05ec13b54d5e2228a9765f26cc8e4e5cff5e5f5bf90c4aed9468252756970257",
      "translation": "你们要和那只怪物战斗吗？我可以带你们，去怪物所在的地方。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5ccfd728a60c953e29017150aa7ab6a5f85ab16a44a3c3f7a8e422f2b4709fee",
      "source_sha256": "70cde72df83e6ffdd7251ef244b02b126cf223da75dacab7b3088f7011837dd0",
      "translation": "好，拜托了。我们一定要救出玛莉丝。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b9bb1ec739578723745724e9ed92215dcc0a7abd145d26d8576a6a23cbd97341",
      "source_sha256": "3d539401deaabf12189d44abe6cc64c28b718c6532a610d6e78012f5b97703bf",
      "translation": "不行！我们的攻击，对它不起作用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4e70437022e5145f0cadd50c4b08beb17ac4eadf3cd1ab66c2563870b0eb6dea",
      "source_sha256": "3d0b6574cfe170319682ce233d06171abda2dc2f5c938ac42f8acbf18067524c",
      "translation": "可恶！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4ed8d21e9e7a7dbc2bd890a1b2872ca4e37a0b9e3a7355009d9d90c4696c6034",
      "source_sha256": "a0888c59710e0edcb2125c6a00d62ec06bb9d0ff478bcb4ecd5c24ad43cf8f31",
      "translation": "克罗塞尔，别这样打了。我们两个，同时瞄准它的要害吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5f362619093dda82b66dd81356388084f627fc3d91a8488f8abf2f96e01cd217",
      "source_sha256": "ad515411f8355b6183c96154ec9514f8daa2a114beedbd128930008eb202d731",
      "translation": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d2fb416bf9cd26c1a6441ec7d4bbea3119e1098245b1f4db76166d7262f06a05",
      "source_sha256": "cccbdc9a95d21d6df4626d9b06b420f4a071c22963e01130fbe1dff79920a762",
      "translation": "你也想救出玛莉丝吧？试着用连携奥义吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ff56611b6c18b4545299a4db5ccc7e2e6771a6c8169d86df5e1a32208fbe4c7c",
      "source_sha256": "dbdacc2a9544872a45f29302b0fb87d229e099657f880958a8f9ddcfa76316fc",
      "translation": "啧，知道了。虽然不情愿，还是试试吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:71a370654968bb3addb80c1b1e3dd636fe5dd4386d40dcfc241939885bd04f64",
      "source_sha256": "4c152f38c975bba0975a2ae4985b3dc5f5a44bc2d564f4c77ad76d20aed6e49e",
      "translation": "像我和洁菲施展连携奥义时，那样做就行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5b440e62368a41fdced36f93b072a649fb76d34a2dbe4ae8928418cdac82c511",
      "source_sha256": "5674a37e49c4a42f42531e0d0e004c96792aab23851518bb26d963bc152df0f3",
      "translation": "明白了。你可别拖后腿。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b959283ec5124e05d7ad3f4084e97965d2a878cf5e185a05a1938cca93ca594f",
      "source_sha256": "cec41518dc9102133af198df31dd16ea1b9f1227a5257d19c0a4250615f454b1",
      "translation": "唔……总之，先道个谢吧。谢谢你帮忙。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4af7ce02c917a442e18feefbd692cfbabc329fdf79b158901bf4b008e1d6d85f",
      "source_sha256": "0fa13552aed49da5f53d4eff16735a0b5c4afefeeae348a3cae7362eca8e5d50",
      "translation": "没想到，我和你在战斗中，还挺合拍。总之，多亏这样，才能轻松解决，真是太好了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:87c41440912683fdf3d041ea0752e67ba785a7e98b8a02e60dd4348710860bed",
      "source_sha256": "7f29da707d5b6497250866e626a9728057ead88a192256dc1d7a93adbe47d77d",
      "translation": "是啊，而且玛莉丝也平安无事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7fc49c86aeb03704529da19250af5a991ec161f684d302c028b06050b1871894",
      "source_sha256": "ee5d64252745406c0679f61c208454426249acab12510c1f2670f191334fdf02",
      "translation": "谢谢你们救了我，克罗塞尔大人、朱特大人。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2295709f074eda68aeb6c613360dc143966013d34f257e62065d72842972435a",
      "source_sha256": "3c9a033f14bc064d244d4cfc188ea2fd15698a62cf3072bbf98f740b87d38f0d",
      "translation": "不过，你怎么会跑到这里来？我们的传闻，你应该已经听说了吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:48c272bfe778b6b577f8e159c0d2ad3e5c14091133d21fe3a097b4853bec3331",
      "source_sha256": "64c8f2ab083aa009a2c2c8ae30070d58136fa1fc49f37d1856abf9a660db387e",
      "translation": "是的……所以，我想克罗塞尔大人，一定遇到了困难……哪怕只有一点，也想帮上您的忙。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:23c5c2d3c939e47d679634016efaf58ee90d46da1059faba2595b162a047a5e1",
      "source_sha256": "e0ab7caf69131c13ed09e563e15b706c959460d2681330f214cbcab9cfea3af0",
      "translation": "你们也真是了不起。差不多，该回村子了吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d9f0f5ca9af1e1f57341c35af67e31eaa0ef5e4168fbca6ac82c5ab5d8c7c49f",
      "source_sha256": "e68ab80aa67823ef9c63d7e37afde33bb6f4af32fb244eacedaa60ef6b81e7d3",
      "translation": "这里太危险，我可不想久留。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:da711a82a7d16ea2d17068e9759644ec4d692ae95ef908749dbdc5f4fc863491",
      "source_sha256": "b1a1edf9447843e5fbaf76a63685f083eaef6c74c4a697583db94c0ca82e07ad",
      "translation": "嗯，回柯塔马雷吧。洁菲说不定，正在担心我们。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9b3ab197444dc544d9e53b49d85fe8f6ff9691ea2d35eb323723f93254fdc6e2",
      "source_sha256": "92687b3f1e3ec9e4e024ab050cf248ce1c935191c9d461ddaa2e008d9e863f19",
      "translation": "你们两个，到底去哪儿了？一声不吭就离开，害我担心死了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ad3e2c14161c540c8ca67f4d3ff6d3aefe843c542c710d1462b3f76d093b93ab",
      "source_sha256": "be17c445137b1eccf939cbfd4caaf9ed38498a8599a6380e37579f4f7e188dab",
      "translation": "没什么大不了的事。对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f6ed567fc3f1fc74a8f3c44c2a730fb7f16616c5e3c574b6128e02d513c46fec",
      "source_sha256": "cb1350b70aab681c5784a542bc8ce03e8b6010e54de8ba67a237e55bd0093a9b",
      "translation": "当然。公主殿下，还真是什么都要担心呢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:25f1d8b7540836f89f4267f04377df834c34f3e018376fce115798cdb1f046ea",
      "source_sha256": "899b1008e7f74e45dc956d5bc182730ebee8ab6fe5e0af83f92b8751ac1e1f10",
      "translation": "唔……总觉得，有点可疑。不过，没事就好。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:79f6da527890bf40ac7d7a99b8e101105b053c2d388ab36ab7c72dcc81422183",
      "source_sha256": "133aecd9b83fd135da71e9a36574795d461d647adb6178241bba863347ce98aa",
      "translation": "这么说来，我好像从来没见过，露姐姐笑过。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c895443e5f432c3e135511a27dea640fab54cfc8d0b2870b905da2877b100cd0",
      "source_sha256": "b3fbb09bded70ac9e618593b5c7d23d5c5f8aa7ab0a328f118d43babeb847d36",
      "translation": "好！我要让露姐姐高兴起来，露出笑容。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7bb41a287875ebf0e668bc8ed7291306204854a6eb1864e97403313ff8514634",
      "source_sha256": "d92ec7b3a9338933a78fd87586dc63aff22b8b4892bef59e413630dffc302020",
      "translation": "只要遇上开心的事，露姐姐一定也会像普通人一样，笑起来的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4e09daa0a513a661a96835f4d2d090347b2f436e3a1314e436f9694ab1669993",
      "source_sha256": "26376ac013d15cf6c620d67f87b4352fc616b6cb3f5165b7087c45dc67b85021",
      "translation": "露姐姐，我需要一些药草，来调配马雷灵药，可正好用完了。要不要陪我，一起去找药草？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c460ab74385f02db2b17f586ad9924be4381c0098da1a1e86aab0407f11b5573",
      "source_sha256": "e4ad9456ed2bec169791aa7bfe04809f885716bedc3bbcd118d08def6d5b5482",
      "translation": "唔……马雷灵药啊。有的话，确实能派上用场。我明白了，一起去吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a7986e91832eccb5d3c80d65053e73362c83e490ece36411e97a33f099f10405",
      "source_sha256": "215902c977ccb4118744d0135fd5a328937f75df0e6346eb078603b71c07f224",
      "translation": "姐姐，它们是不是很厉害？哈哈，明明是猫，却会说话！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d98d620566349989e7904899e200c016fba8c5a72475328e1f2eda9cfe3e3b63",
      "source_sha256": "a6caf53f4735fdcd7c49f95b04bc8221458ddce7a112ed95baebd50ce8a1c3ee",
      "translation": "……难道，你不知道猫猫吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0934cba870b15d1e28ad3e027380fb79d80a02668a983ad4ca059ecb32adb1da",
      "source_sha256": "f38d433836d852d282ecf2190eecd7d054d1e223f04b46337acc560a7528a4f8",
      "translation": "好久不见喵。希望你能收下这个喵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fcf5b01b4de086fad7e3572ef463f64423d22d8d00c953cde07115eb3d657ce3",
      "source_sha256": "3a16a98b737333495c70145de8721a057c5a2f82323339146bc8cc6381448c42",
      "translation": "这是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b33b991aedf1e7954e6ef5a58bb6b5620908de105660c5278588dd30400739ae",
      "source_sha256": "cf5ead8265bb5aac49b75c9a0d4ade1c3d97e5bb5cb3c2a75f00114ca926e27d",
      "translation": "礼物喵。我们猫猫，有给善良的人送礼物的习俗喵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5fba1ddca4818b3d1c7f893726b7e86bd3e1af5a18217d8b73524da2b5bb5093",
      "source_sha256": "f932d954736f9bb6a9bc04683d8be29f1d413808c84bca70323e4936f4c14b96",
      "translation": "善良的人……？你是说我吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:621b3d9c328aa8fd8c27f65fb78c13c315bb0e465712d95e4a5b871dae7b4fb4",
      "source_sha256": "d0a776c700ed81fa2357fcbdcacdfd43669c8b7879643fd5aced84bd5a45b3ec",
      "translation": "没错喵。虽然看起来面无表情，但你的眼神里，充满了温暖喵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:249da7c2b49c04965abcf7603d26ec7d9deaaf1f0bfddb4583b7897f733ec6f0",
      "source_sha256": "0718b625479bf653419febff1fca656e2c583b2dcac8b0830566a547fa7ede0a",
      "translation": "我可没听说过，猫猫有这种习俗。塞蕾丝汀，药草的事，怎么样了？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:447754781b24a6dabad28f04275711d655c869348f8ba4abf05ba11a5be4ddc7",
      "source_sha256": "b61db27829af8182bc8bcef006514f1c8c0d7540f9bf8775a01a88b97451dc06",
      "translation": "这、这个……其实，我只是想让姐姐开心……呜，姐姐根本就不笑。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b89fc0100703f9c5e8f47ef7b8d00162df5c8a1477081eacba49b4b8167fe375",
      "source_sha256": "ce7e9f45bc138cea58336e69084b5f546dda298be130521d2a2c0081ab457676",
      "translation": "唉……我要回去了。现在，可不是做这种事的时候。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2fa73fa766d66b2470bd205b0dc899953d7377e10f1c5c37a2f54bca401f795e",
      "source_sha256": "fb54152d8936f6f20dc6700aff8a0ffc3e5b549af6cdb5c10cdd795fbeea6ceb",
      "translation": "大、大事不好了喵！！我们猫猫的宿敌，黑猫猫那些家伙攻过来了喵！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:922c71db7d44dac6b18770209a213e53bbea35fea3df862ac55b39b4258b8d76",
      "source_sha256": "0d74a776c652839be7b8445996ab0680b29de0c22feed461da4b77ed8ecea19f",
      "translation": "黑猫猫！？不好意思，请帮帮我们喵！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7a7c178099ddbf083a6862c77ef877384991a816bd34f92700ae38da04c8f127",
      "source_sha256": "0b04958b5eee64e8e90b1c1d39a3a45368325fbe93f19ec9cbe511c9d8e4448a",
      "translation": "塞蕾丝汀，战斗时我想到，我们两个，还是互相配合比较好。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fef3038b534e7b7a55e31506c149e29a4ee803aa398cabc256962ba0193ce526",
      "source_sha256": "e7af4831b5f878cdf3380d0176658476d162972c74e695a0b6a87a4a5800b66c",
      "translation": "咦？就像朱特哥哥和洁菲姐姐一样？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:055cda245f99616abf631cb0d93fb6d2c7715ae709762bb2797e487c25dc0c81",
      "source_sha256": "97622311578be007c588d70ede629fac4363c090fe3a04cf93a436225697b3e1",
      "translation": "是的。你用弓射击对手的同时，我也投出手里剑，攻击对手。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:02267275f8a2619a872d1ae81fc6a0a37bbb97c190fe0f64c7f3539789e67f60",
      "source_sha256": "51c16efbfe865d0c72dbda0ebea114ee47a6a83dad85d3b59a24fb45f10fe52e",
      "translation": "诀窍和朱特与公主殿下，施展连携奥义时一样。能做到吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:96cc22e5bb4de4993f8a80ff7f0e36cf6d91ce7ac233d9faae5bba6f0c8449d9",
      "source_sha256": "ad7c6d6f855112512b5b1e083c489fcb2836a337d8a789ecebc2dc99f603c6e9",
      "translation": "嗯，我试试！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:134adad8d45f5699ea81c7b6ac84477f723370799fc3176c54aaf11f1fcddac5",
      "source_sha256": "6ea0c75e13ee98d507d3967d701473d4e2b8778aee26b97b5e7c6c62e64e2568",
      "translation": "谢谢你喵。果然和我看见的一样，你很善良喵。你救了陷入困境的猫猫喵喵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:89fc96fde77e2e41c63a8fa7923d21111ea703510d624a99764e91ecf2e6fb1b",
      "source_sha256": "c0a3cd192d6ecd05c4cd0ae2e7eccee4256713206332342b280f50d3d24e7501",
      "translation": "我还不至于冷酷到，能对身陷险境的人视而不见。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f069401ffc586039fe11190490a1ebe1a19a814508b169f5230ac8ec638f4e1c",
      "source_sha256": "b84b935dbbde7f0d54ed8430ae9ccf76cff8acdf9c3db7579c134cba02e28512",
      "translation": "我们猫猫，很会看人喵。你没必要，这样压抑自己的感情喵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:65f44bdd905b67e0d210b9bc5210fdb1d5bb6b5b7df28736453849fa9ccbc52d",
      "source_sha256": "a3749d66d87dd4025be7f0dddf52c94ccceccb2b44d65cff4b57be7ecffcc400",
      "translation": "人类真是复杂的生物喵。只要再坦率一点，大家都能幸福起来喵～",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:56c9b6ff16958d0234a1b311f8a66ceea52d80da7f1b2f3bd16655f6446c306a",
      "source_sha256": "5fe406ebe0e0b632bf08b57da37fa544ca9b2d87fd3b7c40072a7b25361d666c",
      "translation": "呼，姐姐……对不起。我并不是，故意想骗你……只是，想让姐姐笑一笑……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4b2939c723d76d41b4b0444540786a938cfb7a6614d3e377a91365cb8434633c",
      "source_sha256": "ab5df625bc76dbd4e163bed2dd888df828f90159bb93556525c31821b6541d46",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d8e98062ae233a93355f46fe2163c890edeeb6b43a960379600d94c2ba6c3087",
      "source_sha256": "f644a84629f21b87fdca698f45a5270c215dd9b02ce1e38608338ae684a50d56",
      "translation": "没关系。我们先回村子吧。还有……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:09f184870f925ec537d20b619a9469a89274b5a993186710ac964dc3960b8133",
      "source_sha256": "9fe5cefde893a4b637e34634fc13be057ca0640f26b5eb41b6c806e900ef5f8a",
      "translation": "谢谢你关心我，塞蕾丝汀。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:143cf9035449ddafa4788368c85d04952cc1803369763563d1b88dc9bf7d99e8",
      "source_sha256": "75b6666f44fb3f1d27968f65ad205c95ff892ba6e3770f2907f69a4f76338103",
      "translation": "啊，姐姐……笑了～！！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a1d7bdbabe941af805fff630239d81a77d24bc7e27de39e38d88cba45865a7b9",
      "source_sha256": "c4436ab63c44dd1298964a306bca2aca75c32643f320e50357e86fdbf0892000",
      "translation": "我有话要转告克罗塞尔，他在哪里？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:00efd109098699813d6e5d384e5138b4b09f4bf58893d2be6eacbf8e51dcc623",
      "source_sha256": "677abbc40ca9e6ba51038d5108d2e3094562d59d10d7b4d91ffb69aa6c5444d3",
      "translation": "必须救出被怪物绑架的[玛莉丝]"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c21d25ec29b9220eb7209bd7fbb47f7e416b19d652bee47e92e77089036e8402",
      "source_sha256": "6fa678fb7aa2ec0e47e6b51febbdc58ef3b9926d2c1968889d781212a2e83fcd",
      "translation": "救出玛莉丝"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0d87c64f42d1b00c07db4c721de54e88494b1a5336ec9afc4d20f5084f4eea79",
      "source_sha256": "0892919e628cb3191714aa1c1cb5250313388dc32e645863a0814f94441e9236",
      "translation": "请小心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3c868851cf2e3ed10d278d22806fab004883ff02f270bcfc129ee557d4376a95",
      "source_sha256": "2792219b5160fe078548df249b773092bb91b0a7ba076bb42b77f5edfba9c9bc",
      "translation": "克罗塞尔大人，您怎么会在这里……！别管我，快逃吧！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:efe1b576c0bb07389442c535d5ccb33cbf3c21cc3166d4b6a689f24333a95b2d",
      "source_sha256": "0305c8590bfe7aaab55f6d3a419b5719bcb78f2afa867f2764ce56d352a037e9",
      "translation": "必须打倒那只怪物，才能救出玛莉丝！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2b49f0f93f717a0a837091ea11b79b7bb450170f217dd9a1369a5faf89af9130",
      "source_sha256": "e3e7f1b6ee49b45ef23247a577329c17d473c5a556c74c21310c178a1b6d7782",
      "translation": "果然很厉害！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a1daf68a6a9af119781972bd6329135520926f5a2e99ccb440f0d0cbaa412940",
      "source_sha256": "7ff99ee92372db0d225e6d6d6fe416f81fc1ae6e164a6b2c5c11d764e0a88b96",
      "translation": "现在还不能回去。必须救出玛莉丝。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fd123ce98c2133f000e6631c53b54b076d268bbbfe060a7645ac871448f20ecb",
      "source_sha256": "9a859c4840f8a7bb885d5a6df9195e9bb5798e8282c06ee46cd3d2bc9b3e9898",
      "translation": "玛莉丝在那边！必须救出她。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a4a39b5b6b21460f945bba74cf9c0cd08fa23edb11c4816e20564999282de56c",
      "source_sha256": "02d4ebee7d03c95aa466be6e9469e91575bc80666abd0f2d1bc793ffc108ae2a",
      "translation": "就算全世界都谴责克罗塞尔大人，我也站在您这一边。请您振作起来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c2464562b6128b16bbb11628d8cf392beeb3fbbb4f1b0f6c617620a1248f9b6e",
      "source_sha256": "274fffdf7ab6772991acf89194e1f25a9d2067de5a4daefbbc85a732686aff75",
      "translation": "朱特学会了新星斩。\\n装备双手剑后，即可使用连携奥义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:46ffd1564475feba367a2760f2931a4846b2a45147c6ebf50349ab4ebda4d23b",
      "source_sha256": "bb1592112d252d434020bb8e55407323215c0f4dbb878b991b5f2c969bc77f40",
      "translation": "克罗塞尔学会了新星斩。\\n装备火球后，即可使用连携奥义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:18453a142cfd6abb3002041bfd0f0e2ba143e00d4aec1a23957b16b463af0a5e",
      "source_sha256": "52e5c3dd73829269195a4cc702a6dedce12e0b34528f359ed810041839a9b40f",
      "translation": "塞蕾丝汀学会了超冰结雷震爆。\\n装备弓后，即可使用连携奥义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:55b75d7acc5bd86658dc3007495144b690312bd511d795f569f05ba871b7130e",
      "source_sha256": "00e37c7ca295a4df46c8be434b02f1ebd772a493d8dfa9e28037b573769e6237",
      "translation": "露学会了超冰结雷震爆。\\n装备手里剑后，即可使用连携奥义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e373bd39bd46fa0990f85c571bae61efc4bade9bc9164dfba3fd68da4c94f1f0",
      "source_sha256": "c5d7cc1c2896a15b9e7fe6bf31554a61f6a97fccf0f2139a7920aa5848732fe7",
      "translation": "以风之连环术与双手剑施展连携奥义，对1名敌人造成强大伤害"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a7e9a3115c24b0dd63eaa1e93b75e28dd24863029da81984189d90da4a7d92a2",
      "source_sha256": "98673f24c42a6edb15a37af21b2d31eefa8c2861e6c87eaec2356759d03c1f6f",
      "translation": "新星斩"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:50a9fae18deef82431f860fdba89293c3af1f0621f9d713e2c5a9cee82192243",
      "source_sha256": "6b83e6b098be560dd6043c39feffda48002376b883cbedbbfe0be66920e2c27d",
      "translation": "以火之连环术与双手剑施展连携奥义，对1名敌人造成强大伤害"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:94ae3762566e45300c3f57829fc6f577ab8fc07ce4261586f491224e70bef606",
      "source_sha256": "6a312f6005e5d58bf82f218afff9b7cb7adc411f1a8114787fdd918a43187c77",
      "translation": "以冰之连环术与斧头施展连携奥义，对1名敌人造成强大伤害"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fb07957f9ed536c4d0efbf82d19a1bf0b7959652526e6dcdaf5f43a85a8b5225",
      "source_sha256": "a788642788e0e63d8fafce4850d4d4fe58edef7d661c2a373e4e4b2c90056fff",
      "translation": "超冰结雷震爆"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dacc826ac97f366f530bdf7db67ae20723de9f871e311ff2351b8ea5bc160a68",
      "source_sha256": "aebd919bd063cdb7e58ba4b276909b0bcfd0e9cd8219bac2bc37e110baf01f1b",
      "translation": "以冰与雷的连环术施展连携奥义，对1名敌人造成强大伤害"
    }
  ]
}
